          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇളവ് — iḷavŭ — \"a concession; an exemption\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പാവപ്പെട്ട കുട്ടികൾക്ക് ഫീസിൽ ഇളവ് ഉണ്ട്. pāvappeṭṭa kuṭṭikaḷkkŭ phīsil iḷavŭ uṇṭŭ. Poor children have a concession on the fee."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "On something: -ഇൽ ഇളവ് (iḷavŭ)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഇളവ് (iḷavŭ) is native Dravidian: DEDR 510 lists Malayalam iḷavu, \"leave, holiday, rest\", beside iḷekkuka, \"to slacken, to remit\". A concession slackens a rule."
            }
          ]
        },
