          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പങ്ക് — paṅkŭ — \"a role; a share\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ആ വിജയത്തിൽ അവളുടെ പങ്ക് വലുതാണ്. ā vijayattil avaḷuṭe paṅkŭ valutāṇŭ. Her role in that victory is big."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To share is പങ്കുവെക്കുക; to take part, പങ്കെടുക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പങ്ക് (paṅkŭ) is native Dravidian, from the verb root paku, \"to divide\" (DEDR 3808). A role is one's share of the work, and പങ്കെടുക്കുക, to take part, is to take one's share."
            }
          ]
        },
